{"id":"conv_04189","context":"A uni student interviews a retired engineer about industry history","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for your time today. To start, I'd like to ask about the new technologies that appeared in the postwar construction industry.","jp":"本日はお時間をいただきありがとうございます。早速ですが、戦後の建設業界に出現した新しい技術について伺いたいです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,5,6,8,14,17,19,39,56,62,75,94,111,261,339,492,944,949,1116,1429,2136,2745,2861,3843,4781,5401,5804,9154,11758,13411],"jpTokens":[{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"いただき","w":1429},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"早速","r":"さっそく","w":2745},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"戦後","r":"せんご","w":2136},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"建設","r":"けんせつ","w":1116},{"s":"業界","r":"ぎょうかい","w":949},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"出現","r":"しゅつげん","w":3843},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"新しい","r":"あたらしい","w":339},{"s":"技術","r":"ぎじゅつ","w":261},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":11758},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Ah, sure. When I first started working on-site, it was still the era when the Japan Highway Public Corporation was drafting the expressway development plan.","jp":"ああ、いいよ。私が現場に従事し始めた頃は、まだ日本道路公社が高速道路の整備計画を策定していた時代でね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,6,8,18,19,21,38,51,63,68,81,232,238,385,402,411,1039,1096,1158,1162,1793,2069,4912,4937,5001,5013,7885],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ああ","w":1162},{"s":"、"},{"s":"いい","w":81},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"私","r":"わたし","w":38},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"現場","r":"げんば","w":1039},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"従事","r":"じゅうじ","w":5013},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"始め","r":"はじめ","w":1793},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"まだ","w":238},{"s":"日本","r